            "review_title": "Review at Runam Grand Park",
            "review_text": "Anh Amắn 🇻🇳\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam12939 contributions\n18\nRefined cafe at Grand Park Mega Mall\nDec 2024 • Solo\nRunam at Grand Park is a lovely cafe/restaurant. They provide an elevated dining experience, the only one to do so in the Grand Park Mega Mall.\n\nI came here for brunch and had a delicious Vietnamese style beef, sausage and eggs served with banh mi, along with a traditional Vietnamese coffee. \n\nThe service was friendly and super polite. On the way out I even bought a couple of gifts. I will come back here next time I am in the area.\nRead more\nWritten December 13, 2024",
